# Members Widget — 5 Design Suggestions

Mockups for new presentations of the dashboard **Members** widget.
Current widget supports two variants only: `rows` and `grid`. These 5 push
further, each using data already available per member: **name, avatar/initials,
email, role (owner/admin/member), joined date, deactivated flag, "(you)" badge,
admin actions**, plus optional **open-task counts** (via subject refs).

Legend: `◐` avatar  ·  `●` status dot  ·  `▸` admin menu  ·  pills = role badge

---

## 1. Compact Directory (role-grouped rows)

Refines today's `rows`: same density but members are bucketed under role
headers so structure reads at a glance. Sticky search toolbar on top.

```
┌─ Members ──────────────────────────── ⌕ filter…  [+ Add] ─┐
│                                                            │
│  OWNERS · 1                                                │
│  ◐  Kalle Renström (you)        kalle@normain.com   owner  │
│                                                            │
│  ADMINS · 2                                                │
│  ◐  Mira Patel                  mira@normain.com    admin ▸│
│  ◐  Tom Vega                    tom@normain.com     admin ▸│
│                                                            │
│  MEMBERS · 14                                              │
│  ◐  Ada Cho                     ada@normain.com    member ▸│
│  ◐  Ben Ortiz                   ben@…    deactivated      ▸│
│  ◐  Cleo Wynn                   cleo@normain.com   member ▸│
│  …                                          View all 17 →  │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Why:** scannable hierarchy without a separate org-chart concept.
- **Data:** name, email, role, deactivated, you-badge, admin menu.
- **Config:** reuse `fields` (email/joined), `showToolbar`, `limit`, plus new
  `group: "role" | "none"`.

