## 3. Team Pulse (workload)

Each member shows an open-task load bar + a status dot. Turns the roster into
a capacity view. Sorted by load by default.

```
┌─ Team Pulse ─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          open   load                  │
│  ● ◐ Mira Patel    admin    9   ████████░░  busy      │
│  ● ◐ Kalle (you)   owner    6   █████░░░░░  steady     │
│  ◐   Tom Vega      admin    4   ███░░░░░░░  steady     │
│  ◐   Ada Cho      member    2   █░░░░░░░░░  light      │
│  ○ ◐ Ben Ortiz    member    0   ░░░░░░░░░░  idle       │
│                                          View all 17 → │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Why:** answers "who's overloaded?" right on the dashboard.
- **Data:** name, role, avatar, **open-task count** (subject refs); dot = recent
  activity (●online/◐recent/○idle).
- **Config:** `sort: "load"`, `metric: "open" | "completed"`, bar on/off.

