## 4. Org Chart (role hierarchy)

Indented tree by authority. Read-only, mirrors the catalog's nested feel
without a dedicated graph tile.

```
┌─ Org ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                      │
│   ◐ Kalle Renström · owner (you)                     │
│   │                                                  │
│   ├── ◐ Mira Patel · admin                           │
│   │     ├── ◐ Ada Cho · member                       │
│   │     └── ◐ Cleo Wynn · member                     │
│   │                                                  │
│   └── ◐ Tom Vega · admin                             │
│         ├── ◐ Dia Lund · member                      │
│         ├── ◐ Eli Rosa · member                      │
│         └── ◐ Fox Marin · member                     │
│                                                      │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Why:** instant grasp of who outranks whom; great onboarding tile.
- **Data:** role rank (owner→admin→member), name, avatar, you-badge.
- **Config:** `groupBy: "role"`; collapse/expand branches; depth limit.
- **Note:** pure role grouping (no manager field exists yet) — branches are
  role tiers, not reporting lines.

