## 5. Summary Card (KPI + avatar stack)

Compact stat tile for small dashboard slots. Big headline count, role
breakdown, overlapping avatar stack (like the catalog preview).

```
┌─ Members ───────────────────────┐
│                                  │
│     17   members                 │
│     ───────────────────          │
│     1 owner · 2 admins · 14 mem  │
│     2 deactivated                │
│                                  │
│     ◐◐◐◐◐◐◐ +10                  │
│                                  │
│     [ View directory → ]         │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Why:** fits a 1×1 / small tile; headline metric + face recognition.
- **Data:** counts by role + deactivated, overlapping avatars, link to `/members`.
- **Config:** `variant: "summary"`; toggle breakdown line; avatar stack count.

