## Quick compare

| # | Variant         | Best slot      | Killer data        | Read-only |
|---|-----------------|----------------|--------------------|-----------|
| 1 | Compact roster  | tall column    | role grouping      | no (▸)    |
| 2 | Avatar wall     | wide hero      | faces + overflow   | yes       |
| 3 | Team pulse      | medium         | open-task load     | yes       |
| 4 | Org chart       | tall           | role hierarchy     | yes       |
| 5 | Summary card    | small 1×1      | counts + stack     | yes       |

All five fit the existing `MembersWidget` → `MemberDirectory` path by adding a
`variant` value (+ a few optional config keys); 3 & 5 need an open-task count
join, the rest use data the widget already loads.
